{
  "abstract": "Lean formalizations of graph decomposition and edge coloring results of Chen and Shan. They cover balanced and equitable recoloring of multigraphs, triangle decomposition of dense tripartite graphs, extension of sparse precolorings in regular bipartite multigraphs, and 1-factorization for regular multigraphs with a dense bipartite core.",
